---
// UrgencySection.astro - "Water Damage Moves Fast. So Should Your Response."
---

<section class="urgency-section-v2 er-texture">
  <!-- Top Red Wave Divider -->
  <svg class="wave-divider wave-top" viewBox="0 0 1440 100" preserveAspectRatio="none" aria-hidden="true">
    <path d="M0,55 C300,10 560,95 880,45 C1120,10 1300,60 1440,35 L1440,100 L0,100 Z" fill="#E62E2E" fill-opacity=".45"></path>
    <path d="M0,80 C260,50 520,98 800,70 C1080,42 1280,92 1440,66 L1440,100 L0,100 Z" fill="#E62E2E"></path>
  </svg>

  <div class="container urgency-container">
    
    <!-- Left Column: Image with Overlapping 24/7 Badge -->
    <div class="urgency-visual-wrapper">
      <div class="urgency-img-box">
        <img 
          src="/assets/images/water/structural-drying-room.png" 
          alt="Structural drying and moisture extraction in residential room" 
          class="urgency-photo"
          loading="lazy"
        />
      </div>
      <div class="urgency-floating-badge">
        <div class="badge-big-hours">24/7</div>
        <div class="badge-caption">On-site within hours to help limit further damage</div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Right Column: Copy & Checklist -->
    <div class="urgency-content">
      <h2 class="urgency-heading">
        Water Damage Moves Fast. <span class="highlight-red-text">So Should Your Response.</span>
      </h2>

      <p class="urgency-lead">
        Water can travel quickly through carpet, flooring, drywall, and walls. The longer moisture remains, the greater the chance of additional property damage and mold-related issues.
      </p>

      <p class="urgency-subtext">
        ER Emergency Restoration responds with the equipment and experience needed to extract water, dry affected areas, identify hidden moisture, and begin restoring your property.
      </p>

      <div class="urgency-checklist">
        <div class="check-row">
          <div class="check-icon"><i class="fa-solid fa-check"></i></div>
          <span>Remove standing water as quickly as possible</span>
        </div>
        <div class="check-row">
          <div class="check-icon"><i class="fa-solid fa-check"></i></div>
          <span>Dry affected floors, walls, carpet, and structural materials</span>
        </div>
        <div class="check-row">
          <div class="check-icon"><i class="fa-solid fa-check"></i></div>
          <span>Identify moisture that may not be visible at first glance</span>
        </div>
        <div class="check-row">
          <div class="check-icon"><i class="fa-solid fa-check"></i></div>
          <span>Document damage and restoration work for your records</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="urgency-btn-wrap">
        <a href="#hero-lead-form" class="btn-primary">
          <span>Get My Emergency Assessment</span>
          <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right"></i>
        </a>
      </div>

    </div>

  </div>

  <!-- Bottom White Wave Divider -->
  <svg class="wave-divider wave-bottom" viewBox="0 0 1440 100" preserveAspectRatio="none" aria-hidden="true">
    <path d="M0,40 C240,92 480,4 720,42 C960,80 1200,8 1440,48 L1440,100 L0,100 Z" fill="#FFFFFF" fill-opacity=".45"></path>
    <path d="M0,72 C220,30 430,96 720,62 C1010,26 1230,92 1440,58 L1440,100 L0,100 Z" fill="#FFFFFF"></path>
  </svg>
</section>

<style>
  .urgency-section-v2 {
    position: relative;
    padding: 130px 0 140px;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .urgency-container {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) minmax(0, 1.1fr);
    gap: 64px;
    align-items: center;
    position: relative;
    z-index: 5;
  }

  .urgency-visual-wrapper {
    position: relative;
    padding-bottom: 40px;
    padding-right: 40px;
  }

  .urgency-img-box {
    border-radius: 10px;
    overflow: hidden;
    box-shadow: 0 12px 36px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.12);
  }

  .urgency-photo {
    width: 100%;
    height: 480px;
    object-fit: cover;
    display: block;
  }

  .urgency-floating-badge {
    position: absolute;
    right: 0;
    bottom: 0;
    width: 250px;
    background-color: var(--er-red);
    color: #FFFFFF;
    padding: 24px 26px;
    border-radius: 10px;
    box-shadow: 0 16px 40px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.22);
  }

  .badge-big-hours {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-weight: 800;
    font-size: 46px;
    line-height: 1;
  }

  .badge-caption {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 15px;
    line-height: 1.35;
    margin-top: 8px;
  }

  .urgency-heading {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-weight: 800;
    font-size: 40px;
    line-height: 1.1;
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--er-ink);
    text-wrap: balance;
  }

  .highlight-red-text {
    color: var(--er-red);
  }

  .urgency-lead {
    font-size: 17px;
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin: 22px 0 0;
    color: var(--er-ink);
  }

  .urgency-subtext {
    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin: 14px 0 0;
    color: var(--er-text-muted);
  }

  .urgency-checklist {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 14px;
    margin: 26px 0 32px;
  }

  .check-row {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 14px;
    font-size: 17px;
    line-height: 1.45;
    color: var(--er-ink);
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  .check-icon {
    width: 24px;
    height: 24px;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    color: var(--er-red);
    font-size: 18px;
    margin-top: 2px;
  }

  .urgency-btn-wrap {
    margin-top: 10px;
  }

  @media (max-width: 992px) {
    .urgency-container {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 48px;
    }

    .urgency-photo {
      height: 380px;
    }

    .urgency-heading {
      font-size: 32px;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .urgency-section-v2 {
      padding: 100px 0 110px;
    }

    .urgency-visual-wrapper {
      padding-right: 20px;
      padding-bottom: 30px;
    }

    .urgency-photo {
      height: 280px;
    }

    .urgency-floating-badge {
      width: 200px;
      padding: 18px 20px;
    }

    .badge-big-hours {
      font-size: 36px;
    }

    .badge-caption {
      font-size: 13px;
    }

    .urgency-heading {
      font-size: 26px;
      line-height: 1.2;
    }

    .check-row {
      font-size: 15px;
    }
  }
</style>
